xpression\">\n              1－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>－\n              <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">20</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"work red small\">\n              <div>＝1－（<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">15</span><span class=\"bottom\">20</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">20</span></span>）</div>\n              <div>＝1－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">16</span><span class=\"bottom\">20</span></span></div>\n              <div>＝1－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">4</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span></div>\n              <div>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"problem short\">\n            <div class=\"expression\">\n              <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">5</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>＋\n              <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">5</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>＋\n              <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>－\n              <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">14</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"work red small\">\n              <div>＝（<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">5</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>）＋（<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">5</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">14</span></span>）</div>\n              <div>＝1＋（<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">10</span><span class=\"bottom\">14</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">14</span></span>）</div>\n              <div>＝1＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">14</span></span></div>\n              <div>＝1＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">2</span></span>＝1<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">2</span></span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column right\">\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"heading\">4.计算下面图形的周长。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"diagram-row\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-caption\">[Diagram: upper-left]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 64\" aria-label=\"三边图形\">\n              <path d=\"M20 48 L44 10 L86 34 L67 52 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"8\" transform=\"rotate(-55 22 31)\">3 dm</text>\n              <text x=\"54\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"8\" transform=\"rotate(28 54 15)\">10 dm</text>\n              <text x=\"48\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"8\">4 dm</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"diagram-caption\">[Diagram: upper-right]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 64\" aria-label=\"长方形\">\n              <path d=\"M13 14 L72 8 L76 47 L12 50 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <text x=\"39\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"8\">7/12 m</text>\n              <text x=\"81\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"8\">m</text>\n              <text x=\"77\" y=\"21\" font-size=\"8\">1</text>\n              <line x1=\"77\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"23\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n              <text x=\"77\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"8\">3</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"diagram-work\">\n          <div class=\"red small\">\n            <div>①</div>\n            <div><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">2</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">10</span></span></div>\n            <div>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">5</span><span class=\"bottom\">10</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">6</span><span class=\"bottom\">10</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">10</span></span></div>\n            <div>＝[illegible]（dm）</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"red small\">\n            <div>②</div>\n            <div><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">12</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">12</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">3</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">3</span></span></div>\n            <div>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">6</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">3</span></span></div>\n            <div>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">6</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">4</span><span class=\"bottom\">6</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">11</span><span class=\"bottom\">6</span></span>（m）</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:9px\">\n        <div class=\"heading\">5.周末，五(1)班有<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>的同学到郊外劳动，有</div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>的同学到图书馆读书，还有\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">35</span></span>的同学留<br>\n          在家中。留在家中的同学比出门的同学<br>\n          多还是少？多或少几分之几？\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"answer red\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>＋\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>\n            ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">24</span><span class=\"bottom\">35</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">24</span><span class=\"bottom\">35</span></span>－\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">35</span></span>\n            ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">23</span><span class=\"bottom\">35</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section q6\">\n        <div class=\"heading\">6.有一个装满水的水池，若第一次放出一池</div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">\n          水的<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>，第二次放出一池水的\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>，第三次又<br>\n          注入一池水的<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">4</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>，现在池子里的水占池子<br>\n          的几分之几？\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"answer red\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">\n          1－<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">8</span></span>－\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>＋\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">4</span><span class=\"bottom\">7</span></span>\n          ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">53</span><span class=\"bottom\">56</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"faint-box\"></div>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n